        difficultyReason = "A travel route with no boss or competitive requirement.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A travel route with no boss or competitive requirement.\n\n1. Track Explore Vashj'ir. Complete Sea Legs and The Abyssal Ride from the Vashj'ir introduction for safe underwater travel and the seahorse. The achievement spans THREE different maps; select each in the guide dropdown. Coordinates from one water zone cannot be used on another.\n\n2. Cross Kelp'thar Forest from the wrecks toward the southern exit: Legion's Fate (40, 30); Seafarer's Tomb (51, 28); Gurboggle's Ledge (52, 51); The Skeletal Reef (60, 46); Gnaws' Boneyard (60, 58); The Clutch (58, 78). Approach each location until its exploration criterion is checked.\n\n3. Continue through the Shimmering Expanse: Shimmering Grotto (49, 22); Silver Tide Hollow (50, 41.2); Ruins of Thelserai Temple (66, 45); Nespirah (51, 48); Glimmerdeep Gorge (48, 47); Ruins of Vashj'ir - approach the ruins (33.72, 53.89); Beth'mora Ridge (50.5, 76.4). Approach each location until its exploration criterion is checked.\n\n4. Finish in the Abyssal Depths: Abyssal Breach (70, 30); Seabrush (57, 33); The Scalding Chasm (47, 24); Deepfin Ridge (43, 26); Underlight Canyon (43, 50); L'ghorek (35, 52); Abandoned Reef (33, 73); Korthun's End (55, 67). Approach each location until its exploration criterion is checked.\n\n5. Reopen the tracked achievement and revisit only unchecked locations. Fly low or land when an overhead pass does not reveal a subzone; the drawn map label alone is not proof of discovery. These are exploration objectives, so you do not have to finish the zone's quest campaign.",
