        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete each named boss and allow scripted finales to finish.\n\n1. Set legacy Raid Difficulty to Normal or Heroic. Fly to Blackwing Descent's high balcony on the EASTERN OUTSIDE face of Blackrock Mountain. Enter the raid there; the inner mountain's chains lead to different instances. Defeat Magmaw and Omnotron to open the lower wing, then clear the side laboratories to access Nefarian.\n\n2. Defeat Magmaw and Omnotron in the entrance wing. Continue to Atramedes, Maloriak and Chimaeron, activating their encounter events as needed; speak to Finkle and activate the robot before Chimaeron.\n\n3. Jump into the pit, let Nefarian join Onyxia, then defeat Onyxia to start the lava transition. Climb a pillar and kill the Chromatic Prototype, interrupting its casts if necessary. Wait for the lava to recede and Nefarian to LAND, then defeat him. For Keeping it in the Family, first lower Nefarian below half health while Onyxia is still alive.\n\n4. Check all six bosses in Blackwing Descent before leaving. A quick airborne Nefarian kill that bypasses the final landing can leave the scripted completion unfinished.",
