        difficultyReason = "Complete nine different Heroic dungeons, including their scripted finales.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete nine different Heroic dungeons, including their scripted finales.\n\n1. Track Cataclysm Dungeon Hero and set Dungeon Difficulty to Heroic. The checklist contains the NINE original Heroic clears: Blackrock Caverns, Throne of the Tides, Grim Batol, The Stonecore, The Vortex Pinnacle, Halls of Origination, Lost City of the Tol'vir, Deadmines and Shadowfang Keep.\n\n2. Clear the seven new Cataclysm dungeons through their final bosses: Obsidius, Ozumat, Erudax, Azil, Asaad, Rajh and Siamat respectively. Use their individual guides for the underwater Tides entrance, elevated Stonecore and Vortex portals, and Rajh's upstairs elevator route.\n\n3. For Deadmines, continue past Cookie: click Vanessa's letter, complete the nightmare and defeat Vanessa. For Shadowfang Keep, continue all the way to Lord Godfrey. A Normal clear or stopping at Cookie does not satisfy those Heroic criteria.\n\n4. Check the nine criteria before leaving each instance and revisit only unfinished clears. The later Zul'Aman, Zul'Gurub and three Caverns of Time dungeons are separate achievements and are not additions to this nine-dungeon checklist.",
