        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Control Nefarian's health before Onyxia dies, then wait for the final landing.\n\n1. Enter Blackwing Descent on Normal or Heroic and clear to Nefarian. Disable automatic damage, pets and procs before the final pit. Jump down and engage Onyxia WITHOUT killing her; wait for Nefarian to land and join the fight.\n\n2. Carefully lower NEFARIAN below 50% while Onyxia is still alive. Aim for roughly 40-45% to remove ambiguity, then stop attacking him. Use controlled damage or a suitable helper if an ungeared hit would kill him.\n\n3. Kill Onyxia and complete the lava phase: climb the pillars, kill their Chromatic Prototypes and interrupt casts if needed. Keep Nefarian alive through this transition.\n\n4. Wait for the lava to recede and Nefarian to return to the floor for the final confrontation, then kill him. This adapts the numbered profit guide's actual kill sequence while omitting the profit phrase; all three replies confirm the sequence.",
