        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Complete each named boss and allow scripted finales to finish.\n\n1. Set legacy Raid Difficulty to Normal or Heroic. Fly to the airborne Throne of the Four Winds portal off southwestern Uldum. The first encounter occupies three connected platforms: Anshal, Nezir and Rohash. Use their wind bridges; after all three are defeated the central route to Al'Akir opens.\n\n2. Kill all three wind lords within their recovery window, using the bridges between platforms. A high-level solo route is Anshal first, Nezir second and Rohash last; stay until each boss is actually down before leaving its platform. If one revives, bring it down again before the others recover.\n\n3. After the Conclave, use the central wind route to Al'Akir. Defeat him through any required transitions and his final flight phase. If attempting Four Play as well, first preserve his middle phase and apply Feedback from a nearby Stormling.\n\n4. Confirm both Conclave and Al'Akir are credited. This raid is off southwestern Uldum; Throne of the Tides is a different underwater dungeon in Vashj'ir.",
