        difficultyReason = "Enter the Twilight Realm and find six small moving fiends without killing the dragon pair early.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Enter the Twilight Realm and find six small moving fiends without killing the dragon pair early.\n\n1. Enter Bastion of Twilight on Normal or Heroic, defeat Halfus and reach Valiona and Theralion. Disable damaging procs, retaliation and pets; start Valiona with a non-damaging pull.\n\n2. Wait for Theralion's Dazzling Destruction and stand in one of its purple ground effects to enter the Twilight Realm. Preserve the bosses throughout; the goal is six Twilight Fiends, not a quick dragon kill.\n\n3. Use /target Twilight Fiend, turn on nameplates and search both ends of the room. Fiends move quickly and can despawn, so kill each with a precise ranged single-target attack. Clear your target afterward to avoid automatically attacking a dragon. You can remain inside for all six rather than leaving after three.\n\n4. After six qualifying fiends are credited, leave through a realm portal if needed and finish the dragons. If you have already completed the boss-kill portion on that character, credit may appear on the sixth fiend; otherwise stay for the kill.",
