        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A travel route with no boss or competitive requirement.\n\n1. Track Explore Hyjal and travel to OUTDOOR Mount Hyjal, not the Caverns of Time raid. Visit the eleven current exploration criteria; old coordinate lists include extra experience locations that are unnecessary.\n\n2. Reveal the northern and western shrines: Nordrassil (62, 25); The Circle of Cinders (43, 28); Shrine of Goldrinn (29, 28); Rim of the World (22, 37); Ashen Lake (19, 48). Approach each location until its exploration criterion is checked.\n\n3. Sweep the center and southern battlefield: The Flamewake (31, 61); The Scorched Plain (46, 59); Sethria's Roost (33, 75); The Throne of Flame (44, 75); Gates of Sothann (67, 75); Darkwhisper Gorge (76, 65). Approach each location until its exploration criterion is checked.\n\n4. Reopen the tracked achievement and revisit only unchecked locations. Fly low or land when an overhead pass does not reveal a subzone; the drawn map label alone is not proof of discovery. These are exploration objectives, so you do not have to finish the zone's quest campaign.",
