        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Take your capital's Cataclysm introduction/portal to Deepholm and begin the Temple of Earth quests. Work the World Pillar investigation in its offered order; Therazane's northern daily area does not offer a shortcut to a fresh character's story.\n\n2. Complete the airship investigation and Middle World Pillar Fragment branch around Deathwing's Fall and Storm's Fury. Follow the Earthen story toward Stonehearth and the western Needlerock conflict.\n\n3. At Stonehearth, look for Peak Grindstone's Close Escort near the crater wall northwest of the settlement. Finish the escort and the next Needlerock hub. This easy-to-miss lead is required to continue the Earthen/Upper World Pillar story on a stalled character.\n\n4. Complete the Stone Lords/Therazane approach and the remaining fragment quests. If the Middle Fragment is done but the trail ends, inspect the cave around 69.33,68.18 for the quest-starting Twilight Research drop and follow its offered chain.\n\n5. Return the recovered fragments and finish Mending the Wound at the Temple of Earth. Check all FOUR named chapters. Buying reputation, killing Stonecore bosses or merely reaching Therazane's Throne does not complete these World Pillar hand-ins.",
