    [4872] = {
        achievementId = 4872,
        name = "Unearthing Uldum",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Unearthing Uldum",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Speak to Zidormi near Ramkahen for the earlier Uldum phase. If no introductory quests are present, start Easy Money with Adarrah's caravan in southwestern Tanaris; follow the capture and escape into Uldum instead of starting in the N'Zoth-invasion version.\n\n2. Complete the Ramkahen royal-family story: Rescued by Outsiders, the High Council's Decision, Promises and the Dark Pharaoh/Neferset confrontation. Follow the main NPC hand-ins between Ramkahen and the southern city; Harrison's archaeology expedition is a separate required branch.\n\n3. In Mar'at, begin Mack's Unearthed lead to Harrison Jones. Complete the Obelisk of the Stars, then speak to Adarrah when Harrison leaves a message. Continue the Obelisk of the Sun and the Schnottz expedition, including Gnomebliteration! and The Furrier, Schnottz chapters.\n\n4. After the Chamber of the Stars statues collapse, KILL A SCARAB in the room to obtain Just a Fancy Cockroach (27627). This is needed for These Obelisks Are Trying to Kill Us!; simply watching the room event and leaving can strand the chapter.\n\n5. Follow Harrison through the Oasis of Vir'sar, Obelisk of the Moon and Maker's Ascent finale. Use the separate Coffer of Promise achievement guide for its longer expedition route. Check all SEVEN Uldum chapters rather than chasing old comments' 108-quest totals.",
