    [4873] = {
        achievementId = 4873,
        name = "Fading into Twilight",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Fading into Twilight",
        faction = "Alliance",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Begin Twilight Shores with Grand Admiral Jes-Tereth in Stormwind Keep. The original Varian investigation is obsolete; use the present quest giver rather than waiting for that removed introduction.\n\n2. At Highbank, finish the landing and secure the Alliance base. Follow the Firebeard's Patrol branch and aid the Dunwald family through their chapter's final hand-ins. Flying directly to Kirthaven before these introductions can leave its later quests unavailable.\n\n3. Continue through Thundermar and the Wildhammer settlements to Kirthaven. Complete the wedding preparations AND Wild, Wild, Wildhammer Wedding, then follow the next battle and Earthen Ring leads.\n\n4. Follow the northern Earthen Ring story through Torn Ground, Iso'rath's nightmares and the rescue from the Maw of Madness. Continue the Vermillion Redoubt defense, Calen's quests and the Dragon Queen's scripted confrontation. Hand in between events instead of simply waiting at their later locations.\n\n5. Continue the southern assault from your faction's base toward the Twilight Gate. Finish the chapters still unchecked in THIS faction's achievement. The subsequent Initiate Goldmine / Skullcrusher finale awards King of the Mountain and may remain after Fading into Twilight completes.",
