    [4874] = {
        achievementId = 4874,
        name = "Breaking Out of Tol Barad",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Breaking Out of Tol Barad",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "One hundred PvE daily hand-ins across Tol Barad and its Peninsula.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - One hundred PvE daily hand-ins across Tol Barad and its Peninsula.\n\n1. Use your capital's Tol Barad portal and accept your faction's available PENINSULA dailies: Alliance at Baradin Base Camp, Horde at Hellscream's Grasp. These are kill/collection PvE quests, not a requirement to kill opposing players.\n\n2. Complete the offered objectives around the Peninsula and return to hand them in. Retail comments confirm Peninsula dailies COUNT even when the old progress display appears not to update immediately. Track the current counter and complete actual hand-ins.\n\n3. If your faction controls the southern battle island, cross the bridge and visit its central quest hub. Add A Huge Problem, Swamp Bait, The Leftovers and the three quests for the currently open prison. If the other faction controls it, return after your side wins an outdoor battle or continue Peninsula dailies meanwhile.\n\n4. Repeat after daily resets until ONE HUNDRED hand-ins are credited. Repeating the same available dailies advances this total; the separate Just Another Day achievement requires different unique quest variants. Read that guide if you also need the rotation workaround.",
        stepCount = 4,
