        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Unlock the Friendly tabard and earn Exalted through quests and eligible dungeon kills.\n\n1. Follow the present-day Mount Hyjal storyline from Nordrassil. Its quests provide Guardians reputation and unlock later Sanctuary of Malorne dailies. This is the outdoor Hyjal faction, not the Scale of the Sands faction in the Caverns of Time raid.\n\n2. At FRIENDLY, visit Provisioner Whitecloud at the marked location and buy Tabard of the Guardians of Hyjal. EQUIP it before entering a reputation-granting dungeon.\n\n3. Use an original Cataclysm dungeon such as NORMAL Lost City of the Tol'vir in Uldum. Kill reputation-granting trash and bosses and inspect the reputation log to confirm the equipped tabard is awarding Guardians of Hyjal. This avoids the seasonal Mythic reworks of other old dungeons.\n\n4. Leave, reset the Normal instance and repeat within the game's entry limit, keeping the tabard equipped. A killed Heroic boss uses its daily lockout and Reset All Instances cannot restore it. Complete unlocked faction quests/dailies as an alternative while travelling.\n\n5. Stop at EXALTED and check the achievement. Buying a tabard or a reputation reward alone does not finish the reputation bar, and a later expansion's tabard converts reputation to a different faction.",
