        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Unlock the Friendly tabard and earn Exalted through quests and eligible dungeon kills.\n\n1. Use a HORDE character and complete Twilight Highlands' Horde introduction, Dragonmaw Port storyline and Bloodgulch quests. Grot is in Bloodgulch, not Outland's hostile Dragonmaw camps.\n\n2. At FRIENDLY, visit Grot Deathblow at the marked location and buy Tabard of the Dragonmaw Clan. EQUIP it before entering a reputation-granting dungeon.\n\n3. Use an original Cataclysm dungeon such as NORMAL Lost City of the Tol'vir in Uldum. Kill reputation-granting trash and bosses and inspect the reputation log to confirm the equipped tabard is awarding Dragonmaw Clan. This avoids the seasonal Mythic reworks of other old dungeons.\n\n4. Leave, reset the Normal instance and repeat within the game's entry limit, keeping the tabard equipped. A killed Heroic boss uses its daily lockout and Reset All Instances cannot restore it. Complete unlocked faction quests/dailies as an alternative while travelling.\n\n5. Stop at EXALTED and check the achievement. Buying a tabard or a reputation reward alone does not finish the reputation bar, and a later expansion's tabard converts reputation to a different faction.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 241, x = 0.5379999999999999, y = 0.42, step = 2, label = "Grot Deathblow - Dragonmaw Clan tabard" },
