    [4927] = {
        achievementId = 4927,
        name = "Azshara Quests",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Azshara Quests",
        faction = "Horde",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Enter from Orgrimmar's northern gate and begin the Bilgewater campaign, looting the night-elf scout's quest starter when required.\n\n2. Follow the Rocketway Exchange's quarry/rescue work and the southern laboratory story. Finish Defending Orgrimmar, Sisters of the Sea and the Azsharite research rather than merely taking a rocket ride to the harbor.\n\n3. At Bilgewater Harbor, inspect the inn's Wrenchmen Recruitment Poster and follow the naga/Heart of Arkkoroc and ley-line branches. The harbor offers more than one campaign direction; finishing only one leaves several chapters missing.\n\n4. Complete Xylem's apprentice chain and all required trial quests, then follow the Azuregos/Kalec continuation to the Northern Rocketway Terminus. Finish The Best Apprentice, Subject Nine from Space! and The Conquest of Azshara, checking all eight current chapters.\n\n5. Check the remaining named chapters, return to their own hub and finish their hand-ins. A quest marker can be inside a building, on an object or just over the adjoining zone border. Unrelated dungeon quests, repeatable reputation turn-ins and an old total such as 60/60 do not substitute for the current story criteria.",
