    [4928] = {
        achievementId = 4928,
        name = "Darkshore Quests",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Darkshore Quests",
        faction = "Alliance",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Use Zidormi's earlier Darkshore phase around 48.8,24.4, then begin the Lor'danel rescue campaign. The Battle for Azeroth warfront does not provide the Cataclysm storyline.\n\n2. Complete the northern rescue/Shatterspear story and the Great Animal Spirit branch. Return to the animal-spirit quest givers after the staged transformation/vision; choosing a spirit alone is not the final chapter hand-in.\n\n3. Follow the central corruption and Eye of All Storms quests, then continue the Devourer/Consumed by Madness story. Loot the quest-starting orders and keys when the current branch requires them, instead of counting unrelated kills.\n\n4. Finish the southern Battle for Darkshore finale and check all six chapters. The hidden Maw of the Void quest awards Ghosts in the Dark separately; do not assume that one cave event completes Darkshore's whole story.\n\n5. Check the remaining named chapters, return to their own hub and finish their hand-ins. A quest marker can be inside a building, on an object or just over the adjoining zone border. Unrelated dungeon quests, repeatable reputation turn-ins and an old total such as 60/60 do not substitute for the current story criteria.",
