        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Begin the explorer quests at Marshal's Stand and the northern expedition areas. Tropical Paradise Beckons in Tanaris is an optional route into the zone.\n\n2. Complete the explorer observation branches and the three crystal-pylon investigations. Turn in the pylon findings to the expedition contacts; simply visiting each pylon's location does not complete its research chapter.\n\n3. Find Maximillian of Northshire and follow his full knightly adventure, including the quest vehicle and staged rescues. Finish its final hand-in for The Ballad of Maximillian rather than leaving after the first humorous errand.\n\n4. Finish Observe the World and The Pylons of Un'Goro, then check all three chapters. Several chapter credits arrive only near the end of the connected zone story; an initially empty checklist is not a reason to restart.\n\n5. Check the remaining named chapters, return to their own hub and finish their hand-ins. A quest marker can be inside a building, on an object or just over the adjoining zone border. Unrelated dungeon quests, repeatable reputation turn-ins and an old total such as 60/60 do not substitute for the current story criteria.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
