    [4959] = {
        achievementId = 4959,
        name = "Beware of the 'Unbeatable?' Pterodactyl",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Beware of the 'Unbeatable?' Pterodactyl",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the Shrine of Aviana vehicle-quest branch.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the Shrine of Aviana vehicle-quest branch.\n\n1. Follow Mount Hyjal's story into the Shrine of Aviana around 44.3,47.9. Finish its egg and Sethria quests through Return to the Shrine and An Ancient Reborn. Accept The Hatchery Must Burn and enter the flamegate around 38.8,58.6.\n\n2. Speak to Farden Talonshrike, take and equip a Twilight Firelance from the rack, and mount an Aviana's Guardian. For Flight in the Firelands, use Flap to maintain height and reach the marked flag.\n\n3. Finish Wave One and Wave Two by jousting the required enemies. Keep enough height with Flap and collide with targets using the quest vehicle rather than trying to cast ordinary character spells.\n\n4. Complete Egg Wave by running the vehicle over FORTY eggs on the ledges, then turn in to Farden and check the achievement. The later ten Vigilance on Wings dailies belong to a separate achievement.",
        stepCount = 4,
