    },
    [4961] = {
        achievementId = 4961,
        name = "In a Thousand Years Even You Might be Worth Something",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "In a Thousand Years Even You Might be Worth Something",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "The complete Harrison Jones expedition across original Uldum.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - The complete Harrison Jones expedition across original Uldum.\n\n1. Use original Uldum, speaking to Zidormi near Ramkahen if the invasion phase is active. Finish Easy Money from Adarrah in Tanaris and the caravan/captivity escape if Uldum has no starting quests. In Mar'at, speak to Mack for Unearthed, investigate the tomb and meet Harrison Jones.\n\n2. Follow Harrison's Obelisk of the Stars chain. Check clickable objects and quest-starting corpses as well as NPCs: the Elaborate Disc, Schnottz Scout and Decrepit Skeleton all advance this branch. After the statues collapse in the Chamber of the Stars, kill a scarab to start Just a Fancy Cockroach.\n\n3. After Harrison leaves a message, speak to Adarrah instead of searching only for him. Continue the Obelisk of the Sun branch, including Tailgunner. Loot the quest-starting book from the officer and follow its quest to Schnottz's Landing for the next expedition branch.\n\n4. Finish Belloc Brightblade and Schnottz's expedition quests, including the fox and military errands, then follow Harrison to the Oasis of Vir'sar and Sullah's sideshow. Continue through the Obelisk of the Moon and the northern Titan machinery.\n\n5. Finish the Maker's Ascent / Coffer of Promise finale through Harrison Jones and the Temple of Uldum, then TURN IN and check the achievement. Ramkahen's separate Neferset campaign does not substitute for Harrison's expedition.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
