        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete several connected quest chapters, including their prerequisite hand-ins.\n\n1. Enable Trivial Quests on the minimap and track this achievement's CURRENT named chapters. Old comments' numeric quest totals predate storyline tracking. Turn in each branch's final quest and take its follow-up before leaving the hub. Begin the Hunter's Hill / northern-border campaign, then follow the Horde military and Cenarion branches south.\n\n2. For Hunter's Hill, check Holgom around 37.65,16.63, the tower quest giver, and Nura Pathfinder around 31.4,13.3. Complete Nura's high-road route through Holdout at Hunter's Hill; these outlying quests can be invisible on the obvious settlement marker.\n\n3. Finish Vendetta Point, Camp Una'fe, Spearhead and Desolation Hold's branches, following each military hand-off. Complete Life from the Dream as a separate Cenarion story rather than assuming the faction assault covers it.\n\n4. Finish Firestone Point's southern story and check all SEVEN faction-appropriate chapters. If only the northern chapter remains, revisit the border NPCs above instead of clearing another dungeon or doing unrelated Ratchet quests.\n\n5. Check the remaining named chapters, return to their own hub and finish their hand-ins. A quest marker can be inside a building, on an object or just over the adjoining zone border. Unrelated dungeon quests, repeatable reputation turn-ins and an old total such as 60/60 do not substitute for the current story criteria.",
