        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A high-level legacy clear; follow the dungeon's progression events and final-boss requirement.\n\n1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Heroic before entering Throne of the Tides. A different difficulty or a similarly named raid is not the requested clear.\n\n2. Travel to the Abyssal Breach in northern Abyssal Depths, Vashj'ir. Swim down through the giant whirlpool to the dungeon portal. This underwater entrance is separate from Throne of the Four Winds in Uldum.\n\n3. Defeat Lady Naz'jar and Commander Ulthok, then continue along the dungeon's available branches and use its transport devices as they unlock. Follow the current Retail encounters rather than waiting for the removed Old Faithful or Prince of Tides mechanics.\n\n4. Reach Neptulon and start the Ozumat encounter through the offered dialogue. Clear the required enemies to advance the scripted phases, then attack the active Ozumat objective when the encounter allows it. Stay until Ozumat's defeat awards credit; clearing only the earlier bosses does not complete the achievement.",
