        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - A high-level legacy clear; follow the dungeon's progression events and final-boss requirement.\n\n1. Set Dungeon Difficulty to Heroic before entering Halls of Origination. A different difficulty or a similarly named raid is not the requested clear.\n\n2. Enter the pyramid in eastern Uldum. Defeat Temple Guardian Anhuur; if his shield phase occurs, use both snake-pit beacon levers and interrupt the exposed hymn before resuming damage.\n\n3. Follow Brann into the Vault of Lights, kill the four elemental warders to open Anraphet's door and defeat Anraphet. Visit the sandy side route for Earthrager Ptah if you also need his separate criteria or quests.\n\n4. Use the blue elevator plate and side control to reach The Four Seats. Defeat Rajh for the dungeon completion achievement. Ammunae, Isiset and Setesh are optional for this final-boss achievement, although separate quests and collections can still need them.",
