        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Master Riding is learned automatically at level 40 in Retail.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Master Riding is learned automatically at level 40 in Retail.\n\n1. Level a normal Retail character to 40. Since patch 10.1.5, the character automatically learns Master Riding at this level; the old 4,000-5,000 gold trainer purchase is obsolete.\n\n2. Check your riding skills and the achievement after the level-up. If an older eligible character has not refreshed its riding skill, log out and back in before looking for a trainer or spending gold.\n\n3. Use a mount in Steady Flight where flying is allowed to see the Master Riding flight speed. Skyriding speed and buying a particular 310% mount are not separate requirements for this achievement.",
