        source = "Master of Twin Peaks",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Twelve component objectives, including long counters and coordinated single-match challenges.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Twelve component objectives, including long counters and coordinated single-match challenges.\n\n1. Queue for TWIN PEAKS through the PvP panel, selecting the specific battleground when available. Track this achievement before the gates open. Warsong Gulch has a similar flag mode but does not award Twin Peaks objectives.\n\n2. Build cumulative progress toward Twin Peaks Veteran (100 wins), Top Defender (50 personal returns), Soaring Spirits (100 carrier kills) and Two-Timer (two personal captures). Track the active personal counter before choosing a match role.\n\n3. Complete the single-match challenges with teammates: Twin Peaks Perfection, Peak Speed, Cloud Nine, your White/Black Lodge defense and the faction's five-race-kill objective. Cloud Nine's nine combined personal returns/captures is usually the largest coordination obstacle.\n\n4. Complete Fire, Walk With Me's personal timed capture, Twin Peaks Mountaineer's dual-buff /roar, and Double Jeopardy's 0-2 comeback. Read each individual guide before consuming a timed powerup or committing to the route.\n\n5. Check all TWELVE live criteria, using your faction's alternatives where the checklist combines names. An individual win or a completed battleground rating title does not award the whole meta.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {},
        areaMaps = { 206 },
        sources = {},
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-10",
