        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Nine combined personal captures and returns during one Twin Peaks match.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Nine combined personal captures and returns during one Twin Peaks match.\n\n1. Queue for TWIN PEAKS through the PvP panel, selecting the specific battleground when available. Track this achievement before the gates open. Warsong Gulch has a similar flag mode but does not award Twin Peaks objectives.\n\n2. Tell teammates you are working on personal returns and stay with the defense against enemy carriers. After each carrier dies, CLICK the dropped friendly flag yourself. Being nearby when a teammate clicks it does not add your return.\n\n3. Add personal captures when a safe run is available. Your combined personal CAPTURES plus RETURNS must reach NINE in THIS match; for example, six returns and three captures qualify. Watch the scoreboard and the tracked achievement instead of counting carrier kills.\n\n4. Coordinate with your own team's carrier/defenders and continue until all nine actions are credited before the match ends. This needs a suitable, long match and usually many attempts; it cannot be completed by adding returns from previous games. Current comments include legitimate coordinated-team completions.",
