        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Thirteen components combine long counters and demanding match results.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Thirteen components combine long counters and demanding match results.\n\n1. Queue for THE BATTLE FOR GILNEAS and track this achievement before the gates open. Its three bases are Lighthouse, Waterworks and Mine. Assaults, defenses, resources and honorable kills are separate counters.\n\n2. Accumulate the Veteran's 100 wins, Bustin' Caps' 50 personal assaults and Not Your Average PUG'er's ten defenses. Complete the two-assault, two-defense and All-Star combinations in their required single matches.\n\n3. Work with teammates on Perfection's 1500-0 win, Full Coverage's ten three-base finishes and Newbs to Plowshares' six-minute victory. Separate attempts are sensible because the comeback and close-margin objectives need different match situations.\n\n4. Complete Don't Get Cocky Kid after a 500-resource deficit, Jugger Not with a win by at most 100, and Assassin's ten honorable kills at EACH base in one match. Visit the southeast waterfall for Double Rainbow's /gasp.\n\n5. Check all THIRTEEN current components. When offered, Training Grounds has confirmed credit for several components, including Veteran, All-Star and Assassin; inspect each individual counter rather than assuming all modes grant identical credit.",
