        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - One location-specific emote inside the battleground.\n\n1. Queue for THE BATTLE FOR GILNEAS and track this achievement before the gates open. Its three bases are Lighthouse, Waterworks and Mine. Assaults, defenses, resources and honorable kills are separate counters.\n\n2. Travel to the waterfall at the SOUTHEAST / bottom-right of the battleground map. Stand underneath its double rainbow until the area text says you are beneath it.\n\n3. Type /gasp while standing there and check credit. You do not need to win or perform an emote at a generic rainbow elsewhere in Gilneas. Return to your team's objectives once it is credited.",
