        name = "Three's Company: 2400",
        category = "PvP",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Three's Company: 2400",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "A demanding personal rating threshold in rated 3v3 arena.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A demanding personal rating threshold in rated 3v3 arena.\n\n1. Use the Rated PvP interface and form a THREE-PLAYER arena team with partners who can queue the rated 3v3 bracket together. Prepare current PvP gear, a workable healer/damage composition and agreed crowd-control/defensive calls.\n\n2. Play rated 3v3 and raise YOUR displayed personal 3v3 rating to 2400. Review losses together, coordinate burst with crowd control, and use defensives before the enemy's lethal window rather than treating each match as three independent duels.\n\n3. Read the personal rating in the 3v3 bracket after wins. Matchmaking rating, another teammate's rating, 2v2, Solo Shuffle and rated battleground ratings are separate values and do not replace this criterion.\n\n4. Continue in an active season until the actual threshold is reached and check the achievement. This is a standing rating achievement, not a retired Cataclysm end-of-season Gladiator reward. Difficulty varies with participation and season rating distribution; there is no guaranteed number of wins.",
