    [5281] = {
        achievementId = 5281,
        name = "Crushing Bones and Cracking Skulls",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Crushing Bones and Cracking Skulls",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Keep a fragile boss and his adds alive through two deliberately controlled health transitions.",
        stepCount = 6,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Keep a fragile boss and his adds alive through two deliberately controlled health transitions.\n\n1. Set dungeon difficulty to Heroic before entering Blackrock Caverns. Stop at Rom'ogg Bonecrusher, the first boss. Dismiss attacking pets and remove damage procs, weapons and gear that could kill him or the adds automatically. A second player makes collecting enough elementals easier.\n\n2. Start with proximity aggro or a non-damaging taunt. Take damage from Quake so Angered Earth elementals actually appear. Face away and repeatedly sit if avoidance prevents Quake from damaging you. Keep the elementals alive; do not use an area attack on them.\n\n3. Collect at least five elementals for the first Skullcracker. Move Rom'ogg away from them before damaging him, so your controlled hit cannot kill the adds. Lower him below about 66% while keeping him above 33%, then stop attacking immediately. Use a damage-reduction toy BEFORE combat, or suitably weak damage whose strength you have checked; an ungeared auto attack can still kill him.\n\n4. A Midnight comment reports using Oil of Immolation while naked to trigger the phase. If using that method, cancel the oil buff immediately after the needed tick and keep the adds outside its radius. The reported damage depends on the character; do not assume one potion tick always leaves the same health. Account for the potion cooldown before the next phase.\n\n5. Let Chains of Woe pull everyone in and let THE BOSS'S Skullcracker kill the gathered elementals. Do not kill them yourself. Gather the next set, lower him below about 33%, stop damage and repeat. Ten qualifying kills are required in total; collect spare elementals where possible because older replies report missed credit at exactly ten.\n\n6. Finish Rom'ogg only after both Skullcracker phases have killed enough elementals. If an accidental hit skips both thresholds or kills the adds, reset before killing the boss and start again. Check achievement credit before continuing the dungeon.",
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 36,
                x = 0.27399999999999997,
                y = 0.27899999999999997,
                step = 1,
                label = "Blackrock Caverns - eastern hallway INSIDE Blackrock Mountain",
                mapName = "Burning Steppes",
            },
            {
