        difficultyReason = "Defeat Obsidius before his shadows can apply four stacks of their debuff.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Defeat Obsidius before his shadows can apply four stacks of their debuff.\n\n1. Enter Blackrock Caverns on Heroic and clear the route to Ascendant Lord Obsidius. Let Raz finish his scripted attack so the boss is available, then select Obsidius himself rather than a Shadow of Obsidius.\n\n2. At a high Retail level, kill Obsidius directly with a strong single-target attack, preferably from range. Do not stand among his shadows while waiting or attacking the wrong target: the failure condition is four stacks of Crepuscular Veil on a party member.\n\n3. If he survives, kite the shadows around the cleared room, use available slows and immediately retarget the real Obsidius when he swaps positions with a shadow. Finish the boss before the debuff reaches four stacks.",
