    [5291] = {
        achievementId = 5291,
        name = "Acrocalypse Now",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Acrocalypse Now",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Keep Lockmaw alive while gathering five waves of crocolisks, then kill the crocolisks together.",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Keep Lockmaw alive while gathering five waves of crocolisks, then kill the crocolisks together.\n\n1. Enter Lost City of the Tol'vir on Heroic. At Lockmaw, dismiss attacking pets and disable damage shields or passive area damage. Pull by proximity or a non-damaging taunt, without damaging him.\n\n2. Wait for FIVE Scent of Blood waves. Each brings four Frenzied Crocolisks, so you need at least twenty alive together. Kite or heal as needed without killing the boss or the growing pack. A passive pet holding Lockmaw away from you can simplify the separation.\n\n3. When twenty are gathered, wait for Lockmaw to stop for Dust Flail, move the crocolisks away from him and kill the pack with your own area damage within ten seconds. Avoid hitting Lockmaw: if he dies first, the small crocolisks can despawn before counting.\n\n4. Confirm the achievement before finishing Lockmaw. If a wave was lost, wait for another before attacking. Count actual living crocolisks rather than merely elapsed time.",
