    [5292] = {
        achievementId = 5292,
        name = "Headed South",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Headed South",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Collect all three personal Lightning Charge stacks before killing Siamat.",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Collect all three personal Lightning Charge stacks before killing Siamat.\n\n1. Enter Lost City of the Tol'vir on Heroic. Defeat the preceding bosses and use the wind route to Siamat's roof. Disable attacking pets and damage procs; start Siamat without damaging him.\n\n2. Wait until all THREE Servants of Siamat, the melee adds, have spawned. Preserve them all. You may kill the smaller casting MINIONS separately, but keep those attacks away from Siamat and the servants.\n\n3. Move the three servants away from Siamat so you cannot kill the boss accidentally. Every player needing credit must stand in MELEE RANGE of each dying servant. Kill the servants one at a time, briefly allowing each death effect to apply, and verify YOUR Lightning Charge stacks after each.\n\n4. Keep the previous charge active while killing the next servant; its short duration refreshes as another stack is gained. After seeing THREE stacks on your own debuff bar, kill Siamat immediately before they expire. Do not use an immunity that clears the charges.\n\n5. If you missed a stack, reset the boss while he is alive and repeat. Only three servants spawn in an attempt, so waiting for a fourth is not a recovery method. A second player receiving three stacks does not prove that you received yours.",
