        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Faster Than the Speed of Light",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Run directly between four elemental warders during Brann's timed event.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Run directly between four elemental warders during Brann's timed event.\n\n1. Enter Halls of Origination on Heroic, defeat Anhuur and reach Brann at the Vault of Lights door. Prepare movement abilities before speaking to him; the event timer starts with opening the door.\n\n2. As soon as the door opens, move through the vault and kill the Fire, Water, Earth and Air Warders in the four alcoves. Continue directly to the next alcove after each kill. Do not stop to clear every trogg pack because they respawn; kill only what obstructs you.\n\n3. Defeat all four within the timer and watch for achievement credit. Anraphet's subsequent fight is not part of the timed requirement. Old advice reserving extra time for the closing dialogue predates a hotfix awarding credit when the fourth warder dies.",
