        difficultyReason = "Gather twelve living Aberrations, then kill them within ten seconds while Maloriak remains alive.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Gather twelve living Aberrations, then kill them within ten seconds while Maloriak remains alive.\n\n1. Enter Blackwing Descent on Normal or Heroic and reach Maloriak. Disable attacking pets, damage shields, procs and automatic area damage. Engage him without attacking.\n\n2. Let Release Aberrations complete repeatedly; each release adds three. Wait until at least TWELVE Aberrations are alive, usually a few minutes. This avoids the risk of trying to lower Maloriak to an old percentage threshold and accidentally killing him.\n\n3. While Maloriak is occupied with a cast, move the gathered adds away from him and kill all twelve with your own area damage inside ten seconds. Keep the boss outside the attack until the add criterion is done.\n\n4. Finish Maloriak and verify the achievement. If you accidentally kill too many adds individually, reset the living boss before using a saved kill; the required burst is twelve together, not twelve across the whole fight.",
