        difficultyReason = "Keep the final Monstrosity still so it creates only one Liquid Ice pool.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Keep the final Monstrosity still so it creates only one Liquid Ice pool.\n\n1. Enter Bastion of Twilight and reach Ascendant Council. Clear the room, then position near the EDGE of the central purple circle before the final combination; standing exactly on the final spawn can make the boss step back and create another pool.\n\n2. Damage both members of the first pair together, then both of the second pair. Let the scripted combination finish while you remain in position. Balanced damage leaves less health on the final Elementium Monstrosity.\n\n3. When the Monstrosity appears, wait for its first Liquid Ice circle, then kill it promptly WITHOUT moving it. Keep other players from pulling it around the room. The condition concerns the number of ice pools, not surviving their damage.",
