        source = "The Abyss Will Gaze Back Into You",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Keep every player's Corrupted Blood below 30 before finishing Cho'gall.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Keep every player's Corrupted Blood below 30 before finishing Cho'gall.\n\n1. Enter Bastion of Twilight and clear to Cho'gall. If only this special achievement is needed, Normal avoids the Heroic death-script issue reported in recent comments. Clear his surrounding trash before starting.\n\n2. Pull Cho'gall toward the center, let combat register and kill him promptly before anyone's Corrupted Blood reaches 30. Do not wait for corruption merely to prove the mechanic occurred.\n\n3. If the fight lasts, avoid the adherents' corrupting attacks, interrupt their casts and kill the final-phase tentacles promptly. Stay near the boss and use your own damage rather than letting a remote taunting pet complicate the encounter. Wait for his actual death and credit.",
        stepCount = 3,
        waypoints = {
            {
                mapID = 241,
