            "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=5363#comments:id=6266021",
        },
        reviewedAt = "2026-11-10",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=5363",
        sourceURL = "https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=5363#comments",
    },
