        difficultyReason = "Kill Glubtok before Fire Wall or move around the rotating wall without touching it.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Kill Glubtok before Fire Wall or move around the rotating wall without touching it.\n\n1. Set Heroic and descend through Moonbrook's mine into Deadmines. Reach Glubtok, the first boss, without confusing the Normal version with the required Heroic encounter.\n\n2. At a high Retail level, kill Glubtok directly before he can create Fire Wall. If he enters his floating phase, keep moving around the center ahead of the rotating wall. Do not cross through either arm of the wall while repositioning or casting.\n\n3. Finish Glubtok without being hit by Fire Wall and check your achievement. You do not need to deliberately trigger the wall if your burst kills him before it appears.",
