        name = "Rat Pack",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Rat Pack",
        difficulty = "easy",
        difficultyReason = "Preserve the Lumbering Oaf and kill the small rats released by its charges.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Preserve the Lumbering Oaf and kill the small rats released by its charges.\n\n1. Enter Deadmines on Heroic and reach Helix Gearbreaker, riding the Lumbering Oaf. Do NOT kill the Oaf: he is part of the encounter and supplies the rats. Disable automatic damage and pets, then start by walking into him.\n\n2. Wait for the Oaf to pick you up and charge into the lumber pile. Mine Rats, small critters rather than kobold adds, scatter around the impact. Target them with /target Mine Rat and kill them with a single-target attack, avoiding Helix and the Oaf.\n\n3. Repeat the charge-and-rat cycle until YOUR counter reaches twenty and the achievement appears. With multiple players, check each player's counter. Finish the boss afterward. Rat kills can accumulate across attempts, so accidentally ending one attempt does not erase all previous progress.",
