        difficultyReason = "Leave the friendly Prototype Reaper out of combat and kill Foe Reaper directly.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Leave the friendly Prototype Reaper out of combat and kill Foe Reaper directly.\n\n1. Enter Deadmines on Heroic and reach the foundry. Leave the friendly Prototype Reaper untouched upstairs. Clear the hostile reapers and other activation trash using your character, without driving the friendly machine through their damage.\n\n2. Once Foe Reaper 5000 activates, kill him promptly while the friendly prototype remains safely upstairs at full health. At a high Retail level you do not need to pilot the prototype at all.\n\n3. If using a lower-level group, keep the boss on the ramp away from the friendly vehicle and assign its pilot to stun and kill Molten Slags below. The prototype must never drop below 90%, including during the preceding trash; healing it afterward does not undo a failure.",
