        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Lower Ripsnarl below 75% without killing him, then allow three vapors to finish Coalesce.\n\n1. Enter Deadmines on Heroic and reach Admiral Ripsnarl on the ship. Remove damage procs and attacking pets. If needed, use Whole-Body Shrinka' BEFORE combat: an ungeared high-level hit can still kill the boss.\n\n2. Carefully lower Ripsnarl below 75% health, then stop every attack. Simply standing there at full boss health will not start the required fog phase.\n\n3. Leave the Vapors alive while they grow into Freezing Vapors and cast Coalesce. Let THREE casts complete. Use the ship's cabin and line of sight to avoid the explosions and knockback; a recent reply warns that being knocked out of position can reset the encounter.\n\n4. Wait for the achievement during the encounter, then finish Ripsnarl. Do not kill fresh vapors just because they reach you, and do not finish the boss before all three casts have happened.",
