        difficultyReason = "Initialize Cookie's food mechanic, take one Nauseated stack and kill him before a second.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Initialize Cookie's food mechanic, take one Nauseated stack and kill him before a second.\n\n1. Enter Deadmines on Heroic and defeat Ripsnarl. Let Captain Cookie emerge and climb into his cooking pot; wait for him to start throwing food rather than killing him during his introduction.\n\n2. Eat ONE piece of rotten, green-glowing food to receive exactly one Nauseated stack. Then kill Cookie immediately. Do not eat another rotten food or stand in its effects until you gain a second stack.\n\n3. Confirm credit before moving to Vanessa's letter. The original instruction to eat only good food can work in a normal-length fight, but the later comments recommend one deliberate bad-food stack because some instant kills before initialization miss credit.",
