    [5371] = {
        achievementId = 5371,
        name = "Vigorous VanCleef Vindicator",
        category = "Dungeons",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Vigorous VanCleef Vindicator",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the nightmare route and engage Vanessa within five minutes; scripted hazards still matter at high level.",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the nightmare route and engage Vanessa within five minutes; scripted hazards still matter at high level.\n\n1. Enter Deadmines on Heroic, defeat the bosses through Cookie and click Vanessa's letter on the ship's deck. Prepare movement abilities before starting. Her Nightmare Elixir starts the FIVE-MINUTE timer.\n\n2. Use the steam valves to escape the opening trap. Follow the nightmare route toward the ship, killing the required nightmare bosses as each section opens. Move around fire patches instead of repeatedly running through them.\n\n3. At the Foe Reaper nightmare, wait until the rotating lightning hazards are visible, then cross carefully through their gaps. Killing the enemies quickly leaves plenty of time; repeated hazard hits waste it.\n\n4. In the Ripsnarl nightmare, kill the attacking worgen and SAVE each named friendly NPC before advancing. Rushing past Emme or the other rescue events can trigger Nightmare's End and kill you regardless of your level.\n\n5. Reach Vanessa on the ship and ENGAGE her before the five minutes expire. The timed achievement is for starting her fight, not completing her kill. Finish the encounter afterward for the Heroic dungeon achievement. Do not follow old intentional-wipe or resurrection shortcuts.",
