    [5412] = {
        achievementId = 5412,
        name = "Tol Barad Victory",
        category = "PvP",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Tol Barad Victory",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Win 1 outdoor Tol Barad battles.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Win 1 outdoor Tol Barad battles.\n\n1. Take the capital's Tol Barad portal to the PENINSULA, then cross to the southern battle island. Check the actual zone battle state and join the outdoor Tol Barad battle when it opens. The island and the daily-quest Peninsula are different maps.\n\n2. If ATTACKING, capture and hold all three keeps at once before time runs out. If DEFENDING, prevent that simultaneous three-keep control until the battle ends. Participate on the character whose matching faction counter you want to progress.\n\n3. Stay through the victory and repeat until 1 wins are credited. Tol Barad Veteran now requires TWENTY-FIVE, not the original hundred. Killing Baradin Hold bosses or completing Peninsula dailies is not a battle win.\n\n4. If the battle timer repeatedly starts near an hour whenever you enter an empty zone, later Retail comments report the shard resetting while unused. Remain in the zone through its countdown and check the live event; no old fixed clock-time schedule is guaranteed by those comments.",
