        name = "The Glop Family Line",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The Glop Family Line",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Therazane progression followed by a rotating daily quest.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Therazane progression followed by a rotating daily quest.\n\n1. Finish Deepholm's World Pillar/Therazane campaign until the Throne offers daily quests. Reputation alone on a fresh character does not unlock the quest hubs. Use the Temple of Earth's unlocked Throne portal or fly north and check today's blue quest markers.\n\n2. At REVERED, check Ruberick at Therazane's Throne for the rotating daily Glop, Son of Glop (28390). It is not offered every day. The original one-time version of Glop's story is not the daily required here.\n\n3. Enter Glop's cave around 68.63,28.61, speak to Earthmender Norsala and start YOUR event. Follow Glop between his stopping places. When he becomes attackable, kill him; at a high level you can finish him at the first attackable stop.\n\n4. Return to Ruberick and TURN IN the daily. Repeat on offered daily resets until TEN completions are credited; simply killing Glop ten times without ten hand-ins cannot replace the counter.\n\n5. Check the achievement's live total after each hand-in. There is no requirement for ten consecutive days, and repeatedly abandoning the daily cannot force a different daily selection or award another completed daily that day.",
