        difficultyReason = "Ten honorable kills at each keep, with fragile partial counters.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Ten honorable kills at each keep, with fragile partial counters.\n\n1. Take the capital's Tol Barad portal to the PENINSULA, then cross to the southern battle island. Check the actual zone battle state and join the outdoor Tol Barad battle when it opens. The island and the daily-quest Peninsula are different maps.\n\n2. Focus ONE named keep at a time: Ironclad Garrison, Warden's Vigil and Slagworks. Receive TEN eligible enemy-player honorable kills in that keep's capture area before moving to the next.\n\n3. Avoid dying before a location reaches ten. Reported behavior resets an unfinished area's partial count on death or battle changes, while a completed ten-kill criterion stays checked. Inspect the live count after each kill rather than assuming an island-wide kill qualifies.\n\n4. If partial progress repeatedly resets during the event, later 2026 comments recommend completing the location counters BETWEEN battles, with normal PvP flagging and eligible opposing players. Match War Mode/phase with the other participants and verify the first counter before committing to that route.\n\n5. Check all three completed keep criteria. The three keep objectives, not tower names or the Peninsula's settlements, determine location credit. There is no need to assume all thirty must be completed in a single battle if each ten-kill location has already checked off.",
        stepCount = 5,
