        difficultyReason = "Kill Springvale before his adds can empower him, or interrupt and kill the adds.",
        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Kill Springvale before his adds can empower him, or interrupt and kill the adds.\n\n1. Enter Shadowfang Keep on Heroic and reach Commander Springvale. At a high Retail level, kill him immediately with your own single-target damage before the guards can cast their empowerment.\n\n2. For a longer fight, interrupt the Unholy Empowerment casts from both the Wailing Guardsman and Tormented Officer, kill them and handle each reinforcement wave the same way. Crowd control can hold one while the other dies.\n\n3. The failure concerns empowerment supplied by the ADDS. Springvale gaining his own Unholy Power through Malefic Strike is a separate mechanic. Do not abandon a valid attempt just because his personal stack counter increases.",
