        stepCount = 3,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Easy - Let Godfrey's Pistol Barrage kill at least twelve ghouls before finishing him.\n\n1. Enter Shadowfang Keep on Heroic and reach Lord Godfrey at the top of the keep. Disable damage shields, pets and automatic attacks. Start with a non-damaging pull and lead him down the room's stairs into the open floor.\n\n2. Wait for Summon Bloodthirsty Ghouls, then Pistol Barrage. Step a little away in front of the boss so the ghouls follow you into the wider part of his cone. Let HIS bullets kill the ghouls; do not kill them with your own area attack.\n\n3. Each full wave contains six, so normally repeat for two waves. If any survive outside the cone, wait for another wave. Check that at least twelve qualifying ghoul deaths have occurred, then kill Godfrey. Keep yourself alive while positioning in the barrage.",
