        name = "Defender of a Shattered World",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Defender of a Shattered World",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Combine all nine original Heroic dungeon clears with the three launch raid clears.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Combine all nine original Heroic dungeon clears with the three launch raid clears.\n\n1. Track Defender of a Shattered World and complete Cataclysm Dungeon Hero: Heroic Blackrock Caverns, Throne of the Tides, Grim Batol, The Stonecore, The Vortex Pinnacle, Halls of Origination, Lost City of the Tol'vir, Deadmines and Shadowfang Keep.\n\n2. Complete Blackwing Descent through Nefarian, Bastion of Twilight through Cho'gall and Throne of the Four Winds through Al'Akir. Normal raid clears are sufficient for these component raid achievements; their separate Heroic achievements are not required by this meta.\n\n3. Use the individual guides for the scripted finales: Vanessa is after Cookie's letter and nightmare, Nefarian must complete the lava phase, and all three Conclave lords must be defeated before Al'Akir is available.\n\n4. Check all four component achievements. Firelands, Dragon Soul, the Zandalari dungeons and the three later Caverns of Time dungeons are separate content rather than additions to this launch meta.",
