    [5547] = {
        achievementId = 5547,
        name = "Glutton for Shadowy Punishment",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Glutton for Shadowy Punishment",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Avoid the trial hazards while building an uninterrupted counter.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Avoid the trial hazards while building an uninterrupted counter.\n\n1. Go to Archmage Xylem's Arcane Pinnacle in northern Azshara around 55.98,12.16. Both factions can attempt these achievements, including after finishing the apprentice quests. Use the corresponding crystal AND its opened portal, or travel directly to the trial area shown on the guide map.\n\n2. Enter the Trial of Shadow around 31.1,26.8. Track the achievement before starting so a failed attempt is visible.\n\n3. Click the trial crystal to start summoning Weeping Souls. Mount before combat begins if you want the speed. Lead the pursuing souls over the glowing trap runes, letting the runes consume them, and move to fresh runes as old ones disappear. Trap TWENTY without taking damage.\n\n4. If a soul gets around the traps, move away or kill that stray before it hits you. The numbered comment describes exiting through the portal to clear an overwhelming wave and reentering; verify that your tracked counter remains intact before relying on this slower method. A clean continuous kite is the direct route.\n\n5. When the required uninterrupted count is credited, check the achievement before leaving the trial. Damage resets the attempt; ordinary completion of the apprentice quest is not proof that its special avoidance achievement succeeded.",
