    [5548] = {
        achievementId = 5548,
        name = "To All the Squirrels Who Cared for Me",
        category = "Exploration",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "To All the Squirrels Who Cared for Me",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Find and /love thirteen different critters across several zones.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Find and /love thirteen different critters across several zones.\n\n1. Track the achievement. Target a LIVING critter and type /love; killing it or collecting its battle-pet species does not replace the emote. Use /targetexact with a missing name to avoid similarly named creatures.\n\n2. MOUNT HYJAL: find Alpine Chipmunk around Nordrassil, Grotto Vole in the northern tunnel and Rock Viper around the central/eastern slopes. Target and /love each; these are small roaming creatures, so search around the pins.\n\n3. TWILIGHT HIGHLANDS: /love Highlands Turkey and Yellow-Bellied Marmot around Vermillion Redoubt, then a Rattlesnake along the eastern countryside.\n\n4. TOL BARAD: on the southern battle island, /love Baradin Fox Kit. On the Peninsula, find Sassy Cat and Wharf Rat around the settlements. The Fox Kit critter is different from the killable Baradin Fox that drops a companion pet.\n\n5. ULDUM: select the earlier phase with Zidormi and /love Mac Frog and Oasis Moth near Ramkahen's water. If needed, both also appear inside the original Lost City of the Tol'vir dungeon on the way to Lockmaw.\n\n6. VASHJ'IR: in the Shimmering Expanse around 53.8,41.7, search the seabed for Sea Cucumber and Rockchewer Whelk. /love both, then inspect all thirteen criteria. Move between nearby spawns if only one species is present.",
